Package: spectrune
Version: 1.9.3.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, iproute2, util-linux
Recommends: zenity
Maintainer: KoSTeL2913 <kostyas2913@gmail.com>
Description: Per-application VPN routing over AmneziaWG/WireGuard
 Spectrune is a standalone VPN client with per-application traffic
 routing. Each connection profile runs in its own network namespace;
 launching an application from Spectrune routes just that app's traffic
 through the tunnel, leaving the rest of the system untouched.
